# Keep the build context small + reproducible — never ship local build output,
# secrets, or tooling state into the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.user
tests/
tools/
load-tests/
docs/
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
docker/
*.md
repomix-output.xml

# Local dev secrets (gitignored anyway) — the container gets its config from
# docker-compose environment, never from an appsettings.Development.json.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/.env
